  "plan": {
    "id": "12w_strength_cycle_aware",
    "name": "12-Week Cycle-Aware Strength Program",
    "description": "12-week progressive strength program for a 28‑yr female recreational lifter. Phases and daily sessions adapt to menstrual cycle: cycle days 1–3 (flow) use low-intensity, low-impact, no heavy Valsalva, no jumping. GP cleared for exercise; program avoids high-intensity and heavy lifts on flow days. Start date: 2026-06-01. 3 training days/week strength with optional light aerobic/ mobility on other days.",
